  "description": "Records as stored at ceb84c5 (schema 2.17, release v0.8.1) before the admission of the framework comparison's cells for the twelve questions given by paraphrase on 2026-10-27 (review/compare-more-facets-2026-10-27.md): the earlier metadata and the IDs the admission added. No stored row changed. The test-only historical view removes the added rows and restores the metadata.",
